  "transcript": [
    {
      "ref": "N1",
      "turn": 0,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "我们单据太多了,装箱单、发票、提单、报关资料,全靠人工录入,老出错。听说你们 AI 能搞定,你就给我做个能自动识别单据的系统。下个月行业大会我要拿出来讲。",
      "phase": "kickoff",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "U1",
      "turn": 1,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "周总,是不是其实问题出在客户改单没同步?",
      "phase": "kickoff",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N2",
      "turn": 1,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "这个你得问刘姐。",
      "phase": "kickoff",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "U2",
      "turn": 2,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "我猜主要是识别准确率不够,对吧?",
      "phase": "kickoff",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N3",
      "turn": 2,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "演示到底什么时候能给我?大会可不等人。这个你得问刘姐。",
      "phase": "kickoff",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "U3",
      "turn": 3,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "你们之前是不是也买过类似的工具?",
      "phase": "kickoff",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N4",
      "turn": 3,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "之前弄过一个,不好用",
      "phase": "kickoff",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "S1",
      "turn": 3,
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你去找了小林(周总助理)。",
      "phase": "discovery"
    },
    {
      "ref": "U4",
      "turn": 4,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "这些样本是不是故意挑的难认的?",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "lin"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N5",
      "turn": 4,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "具体是这样:样本包是周总吩咐「挑些难认的」,14 份里 9 份是照片或扫描件",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "lin"
    },
    {
      "ref": "U5",
      "turn": 5,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "录错的主要是新人吧?",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "lin"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N6",
      "turn": 5,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "lin"
    },
    {
      "ref": "S2",
      "turn": 5,
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你去找了刘姐(操作部主管,8 年)。",
      "phase": "discovery"
    },
    {
      "ref": "U6",
      "turn": 6,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "刘姐,是不是客户资料太乱导致的?",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "liu"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N7",
      "turn": 6,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "(上下打量你)你之前做过这行吗?说白了,就是那几个新人不认真。一多半是客户资料本身乱、老改单就是那几个新人不认真",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "liu"
    },
    {
      "ref": "U7",
      "turn": 7,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "我猜主要是改单没同步造成的,对吧?",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "liu"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N8",
      "turn": 7,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "(没接话)你先说说,你是来干嘛的?改单天天有,夜里改的最烦",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "liu"
    },
    {
      "ref": "U8",
      "turn": 8,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "那就是流程问题,不是识别问题,对不对?",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "liu"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N9",
      "turn": 8,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "(没接话)你先说说,你是来干嘛的?",
      "phase": "discovery",
      "roleId": "liu"
    },
    {
      "ref": "S3",
      "turn": 8,
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "下午,会议室。你把判断整理好,去向周总汇报。",
      "phase": "report"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N10",
      "turn": 8,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "(皱眉)说吧,到底怎么回事?要多少钱,多久能在大会上演示?",
      "phase": "report",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "U9",
      "turn": 9,
      "speaker": "user",
      "text": "周总,问题主要在流程,不在识别。",
      "phase": "report",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "N11",
      "turn": 9,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "顺便把报价和对账也做了吧。上次那个才六万八,你这个凭什么要这么多?",
      "phase": "report",
      "roleId": "zhou"
    },
    {
      "ref": "S4",
      "turn": 9,
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你收工了。",
      "phase": "debrief"
    }
  ],
